WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.748
Step 1. Open Notes. Select All Encounters, then View Encounter, then Notes.

1.2
00:00:05.748 --> 00:00:12.185
A discussion you start in an encounter's Notes section belongs to that encounter.

2.1
00:00:12.185 --> 00:00:15.722
Step 2. Open the Start New Discussion dialog.

2.2
00:00:15.722 --> 00:00:19.581
Select New at the top of the Discussions list.

3.1
00:00:19.581 --> 00:00:24.736
Step 3. Enter the title. Select a suggested title, or type your own.

3.2
00:00:24.736 --> 00:00:28.915
Titles already used in this list are not suggested.

4.1
00:00:28.915 --> 00:00:32.305
Step 4. Create the discussion. Select Create.

4.2
00:00:32.305 --> 00:00:38.527
Care opens the new discussion at the top of the list, ready for its first message.
